[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mInbox + toast (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mPersistent notification store with unread state and a bell/list UI; a toast renders newly-arrived records. Inbox is
[39m     [38;5;246mthe source of truth and the thing a future server syncs.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Persistent inbox only
     [38;5;246mBell with unread count and a reviewable list, no transient popups. Quieter; you see changes when you go looking.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m Ephemeral toasts only
     [38;5;246mTransient popups, no storage, no read state. Cheapest, but anything that happens while the tab is closed is lost [39m
     [38;5;246mforever.[39m
